        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions #BR Decorative Beaded Rosette</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative beaded rosette can be added to door stops, cabinet knobs and cabinet pulls. Available in 5 different finishes to compliment or contrast your other hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThey are supplied standard with <a href=\"/products/small-bamboo-shower-door-pull-first-impressions-sd-gdp625005sbr\"><b>First Impressions small Bamboo Shower Door Pulls</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/11-3-4-inch-bamboo-shower-door-pull-set-first-impressions-pr-sd-gdp6250011sbr\"><b>12 Inch Bamboo Shower Door Pulls</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThey are often used with <a href=\"/collections/decorative-door-stops\"><b>First Impressions Decorative Door Stops</b></a> specially with the <a href=\"/products/2-5-8-inch-wall-mount-decorative-door-stop-first-impressions-fii-mg25\"><b>First Impressions MG25 Door Stop</b></a>  and the <a href=\"/products/satin-nickel-bamboo-door-stop-first-impressions-1931-us15\"><b>Bamboo Door Stop</b></a> as a decorative back plate. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions BR Decorative Beaded Rosette\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
